  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "New, unreviewed instructional candidate for the sliding bearing in phy6-c3-s27. Preserve the source's housing view and longitudinal section, component numbers, the shaft's contact with the bushing, and the oil inlet above the bushing. This is a schematic reconstruction, not recovery of historical modern bytes or independent approval.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/6p/figures/fig-79.png",
      "sha256": "9aa85a82ad65987d4fa66c8b7d38a8aeebb574dac4706e67cb31cb3157af7f89"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "phy6-c3-s27",
        "text": "机器中不需要的摩擦会使运动部件发热和磨损。\n工程中可以通过改善接触表面、使用合适的润滑剂等方法减小这类摩擦。\n为了支承转轴并减小有害摩擦，机器常使用轴承。\n\n滑动轴承中与轴直接配合的零件叫作轴瓦；\n原书列举的材料有青铜、铸铁和钢。\n轴瓦内表面还可敷设适合的材料，原书举出的例子是巴氏合金$\\text{\\textcircled{1}}$，同时还要进行润滑。\n\n图 79 中，轴 3 相对轴瓦 2 的表面滑动，所以这种轴承叫作滑动轴承。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy6-c3-s27",
        "text": "图 79 滑动轴承：1—轴承架，2—轴瓦，3—轴，4—加油孔."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy6-c3-s27",
        "exercise": "4",
        "text": "（4）在机器中使用轴承的目的是什么？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy6-c3-s27",
        "exercise": "5",
        "text": "（5）滑动轴承和滚珠轴承的构造各是怎样的？"
      }
    ],
